      ":question/problem": "Let ${v}_{1},{v}_{2},{v}_{3}$ be linearly independent vectors, and suppose that the vector $w$ can be written as a linear combination of ${v}_{1},{v}_{2},{v}_{3}.$ Which of the following statements are true?\n\nI. ${v}_{1},{v}_{2}$ form a basis of $\\text{Span}\\{{v}_{1},{v}_{2}\\}$\n\nII. $\\text{dim}(\\text{Span}\\{{v}_{1},{v}_{2},{v}_{3}\\})=2$\n\nIII. $\\text{dim}(\\text{Span}\\{{v}_{1},{v}_{2},{v}_{3},w\\})=3$"
